# Private material: kept locally, never pushed
archive/

# Lecture notes: sources and the notes PDF stay private until the end of the
# course; only the chapter exercise sheets (without solutions) are published. The combined
# sheet exercises/exercises.pdf is built locally for cross-references only.
# To release the notes, add: !lectures/lecture_notes.pdf, !lectures/chapter[1-8].pdf and
# !lectures/background.pdf
lectures/*
exercises/*
# Chapter sheets are released as the course progresses: widen the range to publish more.
!exercises/exercises_chapter[1-2].pdf

